# KnowMe CareerForge MDC Rules

1. Enforce Evidence-First discipline: Never hallucinate ungrounded claims (L1~L3 only).
2. Edit exclusively in `workspace/resume.html` intermediate working canvas.
3. Use `python3 scripts/search-template.py` to pick the optimal template.
4. Use `python3 scripts/instantiate-resume.py` to generate the self-contained canvas.
5. Validate using `python3 scripts/validate-resume.py` before rendering PDF.
